id: tai-chi-practitioner
name: Tai Chi Practitioner
talentCategory: insightful
prerequisites: Insightful Warrior or Balanced in Yin and Yang
description: >
  Your fluid movements and reactive combat style allow you to turn your opponents’ power against them.
text: >
  Tai Chi Practitioner: Your fluid movements and reactive combat style allow you to turn your opponents’ power against them.
  –Prerequisites: Insightful Warrior or Balanced in Yin and Yang
  (1)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: Regain Ki Points equal to 1/2 of your Insight Modifier.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you are hit by an Opponent’s Attacking Maneuver, increase your Damage Reduction by 1/4 (rounded up) of that Opponent’s Might for the duration of that Maneuver.

---

# (1) As your turn begins - with Tai Chi Master (its (2)), as many Life Points as well.
[triggered/start-of-turn, effect 1]
ki.value += floor(insight.mod / 2);
if (hasTalent("tai-chi-master")) {
  life.value += floor(insight.mod / 2);
}

# (2) Hit by an Opponent's Attacking Maneuver: 1/4 of their Might, rounded up, on your Damage Reduction against it (chat.mjs
# taiChiReductionFor). Ticked as it happens, once a Round, no button - and with Tai Chi Expert (its (1): "loses its 1/Round
# Keyword") no limit, and the Triggered/Automatic button (the user's).
[triggered/being-hit, 1/round, chosen]
requires !hasTalent("tai-chi-expert");
reduction.taiChi = true;

[triggered/being-hit, effect 2]
requires hasTalent("tai-chi-expert");
reduction.taiChi = true;
